    "body": "> Would it make sense to fix caniuse to just point to the header ID? Which will then be present in both dev and normal editions. That's what I did a while back with several sections.\r\n\r\nI had assumed Alexis intentionally had it pointing to the fragment ID for the `Path2D()` constructor — because I dunno maybe he has some policy or whatever about consistently doing that — but anyway it seems objectively better to have it point to the heading ID instead, so I raised https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/pull/3777 to make it do that.",
